{
  "label": "Review",
  "description": "Does what was built match what each layer said it would be? A conformance pass per layer, two independent lenses, merged findings, a disposition, a person's verdict, and corrections. A revise names the failing layer and the feature's build re-enters it.",
  "limits": {
    "max_iterations": 3
  },
